    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Evidence and uncertainty",
      "items": [
        "VERIFIED = inspected source at ded15187b5fe; source references are static evidence, not runtime traces.",
        "INFERRED = configuration-based deployment assumption; explicitly prefixed on its arrow.",
        "No origin remote exists. Source paths and pinned excerpts are available in source.html; no remote identity is invented."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Ownership",
      "items": [
        "app.main owns SQLite I/O; Engine receives FAQ rows and searches memory.",
        "chat() calls generate() only when use_ai; generate() requires answered + enabled.",
        "Only question + selected FAQ evidence go to the provider; failures retain the stored FAQ answer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Deployment qualification",
      "items": [
        "The tunnel service reads ~/.cloudflared/ttech.yml, which is outside this repository.",
        "The checked-in example points to localhost:8088; actual deployment topology is INFERRED.",
        "Systemd invokes uvicorn app.main:app; Python calls Ollama over HTTP, with no direct FFI."
      ]
    },
